From: cf395831e34e3e8f56a56021ddfe62a15e0f0437
Subject: [PATCH] bpf: btf: Fix a missing check bug

上游 backport, 来自 mt6873-dev/android_kernel_xiaomi_mt6885@cgroup-v2
原提交日期: 2018-10-07T20:23:15Z

原提交: https://github.com/mt6873-dev/android_kernel_xiaomi_mt6885/commit/cf395831e34e3e8f56a56021ddfe62a15e0f0437

---
diff --git a/kernel/bpf/btf.c b/kernel/bpf/btf.c
--- a/kernel/bpf/btf.c
+++ b/kernel/bpf/btf.c
@@ -2068,6 +2068,9 @@ static int btf_parse_hdr(struct btf_verifier_env *env, void __user *btf_data,
 
 	hdr = &btf->hdr;
 
+	if (hdr->hdr_len != hdr_len)
+		return -EINVAL;
+
 	btf_verifier_log_hdr(env, btf_data_size);
 
 	if (hdr->magic != BTF_MAGIC) {